	print(Render(""))
	// Output:
	// # Rate Limiter
	//
	// Demo of the [`p/moul/x/daily/ratelimit`](/p/moul/x/daily/ratelimit/v0) library — an on-chain token-bucket limiter (port of `golang.org/x/time/rate`).
	//
